{
  "_doc": "What kind of value each talent's soft effects (utility, surv, sustain) are, so that each scenario (profiles.json `kind_weights`) and each playstyle (specs/<class>.json `kind_weights`) can weight them: a root that lets a caster kite is worth something while leveling a frost mage and nothing to a warrior or to anyone in a raid. The kind applies to every effect of that channel of the talent (both games unless `games` limits it); an effect's own `kind` field wins. `needs_pet`: every effect of the talent counts only while the build has a pet out (Lone Wolf, Demonic Sacrifice or a pet-less model switches it off); a name (\"Succubus\") asks for that pet: a pet source tagged `ability:<name>`. Loaded by effects.load_effects; applied in model.Evaluator.score. Surv effects scoped surv:parry / surv:dodge / surv:block are `avoid` without an entry here.",
