    "kite": "Roots, slows, knockbacks and freezes on the enemy used to open distance and keep fighting from range (or to walk away).",
    "stun": "Stuns, incapacitates, fears, silences, interrupts and disarms: incoming damage or a cast stops for a moment.",
    "stick": "Snares that keep a fleeing target in reach (runners while leveling, a player running away).",
    "move": "Your own movement: travel speed, gap closers, sprints.",
    "range": "Longer spell or shot range.",
    "stealth": "Stealth detection level, stealth speed and opener cost.",
